  "title": "Motilli Celery Juice Gummies",
  "body_html": "<p>Motilli Celery Juice Gummies combine FOS prebiotic fiber, celery juice powder and chlorophyllin. FOS feeds beneficial gut bacteria and can help support regular bowel movements.</p><p>Take two green-apple gummies daily with water. Each bottle contains 60 gummies: a 30-day supply.</p><p>Choose one, three or five bottles. Every option includes a 90-day money-back guarantee from delivery, even on opened bottles.</p>",
